cv3 ingests three upstream datasets at run time and reproduces excerpts of each
in testdata/ for its test suite. No upstream dataset is otherwise redistributed:
every database is built locally by `cv3 sync`.

NVD CVE 2.0 feeds — https://nvd.nist.gov/vuln/data-feeds
